# 3. CORE PRODUCT PHILOSOPHY

Follow these principles throughout the application:

1. Every financial transaction must be digitally recorded.
2. Every vehicle must have a unique digital identity.
3. Every stock movement must be traceable.
4. Every payment must be linked to a customer, invoice or business transaction.
5. Every expense must have a category and supporting documentation.
6. Every sensitive action must be permission-controlled.
7. Every important modification must create an audit record.
8. Employees must never be able to delete or secretly modify finalized financial records.
9. The owner must have centralized visibility across all branches.
10. The application must be easy enough for non-technical dealership employees.
11. The accounting system must use proper double-entry bookkeeping.
12. GST calculations must be configurable and compliant with applicable Indian tax rules.
13. All modules must be interconnected rather than functioning as separate applications.
14. Never use fabricated transaction data as actual business information.
15. Never display fake financial figures as real dashboard metrics.

The central operating philosophy is:

"OWNER HAS CONTROL. EMPLOYEES HAVE PERMISSIONS. EVERY TRANSACTION LEAVES A TRACE."

